  "source": "WCAG 2.2 SC 3.1.1 Language of Page; H57; HTML §3.2.6.2 (lang is inherited within a document only)",
  "applicability": "Rendered same-origin iframe documents (also in open shadow roots): the frame is not display:none/visibility:hidden, not aria-hidden, not role=none/presentation, larger than 1x1 px.",
  "expectation": "Fails for every applicable frame document whose root html element has no\nnon-empty lang: lang does not inherit across the document boundary, so the\nembedded content's language is not programmatically determinable although it\nis part of the page. A frame document with lang passes. Collapsed or hidden\nframes present nothing and do not apply. Cross-origin frames cannot be read\n(frame-tested). One finding per frame.",
